    {
      "id": "TEYGEN1CYhDPJxBVflfmH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -871.5871075523103,
      "y": 8122.122950274799,
      "width": 1280.3947197160685,
      "height": 45.02979611686102,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5U",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 272923394,
      "version": 298,
      "versionNonce": 792836318,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783157636353,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Users should be able to view a feed of posts from people they follow.",
      "fontSize": 36.02383689348882,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Users should be able to view a feed of posts from people they follow.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "L6X9CqT1jaL9UvGWPv803",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -807.9454045907094,
      "y": 8192.629987159638,
      "width": 1945.3587728162254,
      "height": 45.02979611686102,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1036110530,
      "version": 312,
      "versionNonce": 695815170,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783157636353,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- News feed generation is quintessentially read-intensive - users check their feeds constantly but post rarely. ",
      "fontSize": 36.02383689348882,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- News feed generation is quintessentially read-intensive - users check their feeds constantly but post rarely. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "FsB3rEmk6RwVLsLP_tRoo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -864.475863036721,
      "y": 9588.930887173341,
      "width": 898.6503600606056,
      "height": 45.02979611686102,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5W",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 914301570,
      "version": 412,
      "versionNonce": 1049816350,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783157636353,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. Users should be able to page through their feed",
      "fontSize": 36.02383689348882,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. Users should be able to page through their feed",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "JQATxfIafhwa5EUPzeY87",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -829.490593965766,
      "y": 9801.678294664389,
      "width": 1596.405517578125,
      "height": 135.08938835058308,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 624656962,
      "version": 497,
      "versionNonce": 1513388994,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783157636353,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- First, we get all of the users who a given user is following.\n- Next, we get all of the posts from those users that are older than the input timestamp.\n- Finally, we sort all those posts by time and return them to the user.",
      "fontSize": 36.02383689348882,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- First, we get all of the users who a given user is following.\n- Next, we get all of the posts from those users that are older than the input timestamp.\n- Finally, we sort all those posts by time and return them to the user.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
