      "seed": 1712872734,
      "version": 37,
      "versionNonce": 1039948674,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783158903480,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- When querying with both keys, DynamoDB first uses the partition key's hash to find the right node, then uses the sort key to traverse the B-tree \n  and find the specific items.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- When querying with both keys, DynamoDB first uses the partition key's hash to find the right node, then uses the sort key to traverse the B-tree \n  and find the specific items.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "O4KDSSZqIVEMs0dAj0f_u",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 202.78589595604944,
