    {
      "id": "mDIZaRIHNERLyc1G7if51",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 219.52731696717228,
      "y": 7868.668576105679,
      "width": 2072.334716796875,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1461107934,
      "version": 95,
      "versionNonce": 924377858,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783158903480,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Secondary Indexes\n\n1. Global Secondary Index (GSI) \n- GSIs allow you to query items based on attributes other than the table's partition key\n- Since GSIs use a different partition key, the data is stored on entirely different physical partitions from the base table and is replicated separately.\n\n\n2. Local Secondary Index (LSI) \n- An index with the same partition key as the table's primary key but a different sort key\n- LSIs enable range queries and sorting within a partition.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Secondary Indexes\n\n1. Global Secondary Index (GSI) \n- GSIs allow you to query items based on attributes other than the table's partition key\n- Since GSIs use a different partition key, the data is stored on entirely different physical partitions from the base table and is replicated separately.\n\n\n2. Local Secondary Index (LSI) \n- An index with the same partition key as the table's primary key but a different sort key\n- LSIs enable range queries and sorting within a partition.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yI212QYiJZULuYlhgBQV7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 228.03166430437795,
      "y": 8221.376149891463,
      "width": 1881.2069091796875,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1833602078,
      "version": 15,
      "versionNonce": 1573466818,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783158903480,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Since LSIs use the same partition key as the base table, they are stored on the same physical partitions as the items they're indexing.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Since LSIs use the same partition key as the base table, they are stored on the same physical partitions as the items they're indexing.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
