      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783159112985,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Strong consistent reads are only supported on the base table and Local Secondary Indexes (LSIs). \n  Global Secondary Indexes (GSIs) only support eventually consistent reads, so keep this in mind when designing access patterns \n  that require strong consistency.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Strong consistent reads are only supported on the base table and Local Secondary Indexes (LSIs). \n  Global Secondary Indexes (GSIs) only support eventually consistent reads, so keep this in mind when designing access patterns \n  that require strong consistency.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
